## 🔐 9. Safety Notes

- Run these commands only on your own Windows computer or an authorized lab.
- Prefer read-only inspection during initial triage.
- Do not delete unfamiliar tasks, registry keys, or services without validation.
- Do not publish usernames, internal paths, or sensitive system details in public screenshots.
- This exercise focuses on detecting and investigating persistence, not installing persistence mechanisms.

